WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.230
A friend pulls out a chair for you.

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:04.110
Or pulls you onto the dance floor.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.530
Which invitation would you take?

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.970
At Mommy and Daddy Break Club,

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.530
parents meet over brunch.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:14.290
The music's playing softly enough
to hear how the story ends.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.530
Our night out is called
Retro Glam Sessions.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.650
One decade sets the mood
for each edition.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.610
Dress for that era, catch the live DJ,

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.350
and get everyone into the photo.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.250
Both are coming to South Florida.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.190
Pick your favorite and join the list.

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.000
We’ll let you know when it opens.
